<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX SLIPS 2.02 POINTS TO 1,394.94.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX SLIPS 2.02 POINTS TO 1,394.94.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index slipped on Friday to close at 1,394.94 points, down 2.02 points or 0.14 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflect trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
